{"id":"05528ab9eaedf978","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing.md","title":"ZFC Complete Subforcing","display":"df-zfc-complete-subforcing — ZFC Complete Subforcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing"],"display":"df-zfc-complete-subforcing — ZFC Complete Subforcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-complete-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-complete-subforcing — ZFC Complete Subforcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4593442242f54cd\" href=\"?note=d4593442242f54cd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-complete-embedding\">58-df-zfc-complete-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (complete-embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4593442242f54cd\" href=\"?note=d4593442242f54cd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-complete-embedding\">58-df-zfc-complete-embedding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit predicate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S\\)</span> (existential projection defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb Q^{\\mathbb P}\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S(\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb Q^{\\mathbb P}\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S(\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inclusion map is explicitly typed before it is required to be a complete embedding; the order-explicit and order-hidden relations no longer overload one symbol at two arities.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-complete-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d4593442242f54cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-complete-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-complete-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d4593442242f54cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (complete-embedding predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-complete-embedding]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb P\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\land\\leq_{\\mathbb P}=\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\cap(\\mathbb P\\times\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb Q^{\\mathbb P}\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S(\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}subforcing\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompleteSubforcingOrder}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})","display":true}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1770","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing.md|58-df-zfc-complete-subforcing]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d4593442242f54cd"]}